 game brings you closer to the top of the global rating. Bypass each opponent and gain a foothold among the elite.<br>Keep an eye on your position in the table and prove that your skill has no equal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/1ab813489bf8c0b3330073711d401d83.avif?t=1757482875\" width=616 height=76 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.poster.avif?t=1757482875\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.webm?t=1757482875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/extras/219705c947aad1dbf8908846f2910557.mp4?t=1757482875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pave the way from Newbie to Legend, increasing your rank for rank. Each new rank marks your progress and brings you closer to the title of champion.<br>Keep winning to reach the top and make history.&quot;</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885830?t=1757482875","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3885830?t=1757482875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/6374a7043cf415c636fe37fb680be84c43340ace/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757482875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885830/6374a7043cf415c636fe37fb680be84c43340ace/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757482875","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id